{{de-noun|f||Preiselbeeren}}

# [[lingon]][[berry]], [[cowberry]]
Preiselbeeren are similar to Ligonberries, but are the species found in Germany and Austria, while Ligonberries are found in Sweden and Norway. They are related to American cranberries but differ in taste. Likely they are likely all the same plant family but taste varies with location.
